import{_ as n,o as t,c as i,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 817 | Transcended Ones and Planes | The Plane-Sovereign Strong One's Four-Dimensional Assessment","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 817 | Transcended Ones and Planes | The Plane-Sovereign Strong One's Four-Dimensional Assessment","no":817,"module":4,"tags":["Transcended One","Plane","Four-Dimensional Assessment","Plane-Sovereign Strong One","Power/Heart/Contribution/Responsibility"],"related":["17-Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standards","29-Symbiosis-Degree Assessment System","23-20% Activation Strategic Plan"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0817_模块4-超脱者与位面-位面至高强者四维考核.md","filePath":"en/0817_模块4-超脱者与位面-位面至高强者四维考核.md"}`),s={name:"en/0817_模块4-超脱者与位面-位面至高强者四维考核.md"};function a(r,e,l,d,u,h){return t(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-817-transcended-ones-and-planes-the-plane-sovereign-strong-one-s-four-dimensional-assessment" tabindex="-1">Entry 817 | Transcended Ones and Planes | The Plane-Sovereign Strong One&#39;s Four-Dimensional Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-817-transcended-ones-and-planes-the-plane-sovereign-strong-one-s-four-dimensional-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 817 | Transcended Ones and Planes | The Plane-Sovereign Strong One&#39;s Four-Dimensional Assessment&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 17, 29, 23</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-looking-only-at-power-is-the-old-world-s-algorithm-for-selecting-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">Introduction: looking only at power is the old world&#39;s algorithm for selecting strong ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-looking-only-at-power-is-the-old-world-s-algorithm-for-selecting-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: looking only at power is the old world&#39;s algorithm for selecting strong ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old system selects strong ones by one metric: combat power. Whoever has the bigger fist is sovereign. The consequence of this selection algorithm: the strongest on a plane is often the most dangerous person — his power has no heart-nature constraint, no contribution requirement, no responsibility binding. Heng Yuan Zhou completely rewrites this algorithm with the <strong>four-dimensional assessment system</strong>: power is only the base; heart-nature, contribution, and responsibility are equally hard indicators; all four dimensions met before recognition as a plane-sovereign strong one.</p><p>Six top-level axioms in this entry centrally embody the republican axiom of Myriad Races: the strong-one selection standard is not &quot;who fights best,&quot; but &quot;who serves Myriad Ranks best.&quot; The anti-predation axiom is the heart-nature dimension&#39;s assessment core; the collective ascension axiom is the contribution dimension&#39;s assessment direction; the causal self-discipline axiom is the responsibility dimension&#39;s assessment content; the law-first axiom ensures the four-dimensional assessment standard itself is a law-level definition, not modified by any strong one&#39;s rise.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>This article focuses: how the plane-sovereign strong one&#39;s four-dimensional assessment operates at the transcended-one (Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm) level.</p><h2 id="i-four-dimensional-assessment-s-weight-design" tabindex="-1">I. Four-Dimensional Assessment&#39;s Weight Design <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-four-dimensional-assessment-s-weight-design" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Four-Dimensional Assessment&#39;s Weight Design&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standards (Document 17), four-dimensional assessment&#39;s weight design is:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Weight</th><th>Assessment Core</th><th>Consequence of Substandard</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Power</td><td>40%</td><td>Realm, energy, law-manipulation ability</td><td>Substandard = insufficient power, no qualification to discuss others</td></tr><tr><td>Heart-nature</td><td>25%</td><td>Anti-predation stance, ethics adherence, mental maturity</td><td>Substandard = high-risk individual; the stronger the more dangerous</td></tr><tr><td>Contribution</td><td>20%</td><td>Actual contribution to civilization, Myriad Ranks, symbiotic network</td><td>Substandard = power decoupled from civilization; great talent wasted</td></tr><tr><td>Responsibility</td><td>15%</td><td>Willingness and ability to bear public responsibility</td><td>Substandard = refuses service; strong-one obligations unfulfilled</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Weight design&#39;s logic is very clear: <strong>power is a threshold, not a high-score item.</strong> The 40% power weight only means &quot;you must have this base,&quot; but the remaining 60% heart-nature, contribution, and responsibility are what decide whether you may become a true &quot;sovereign strong one.&quot; A cultivator with full marks in power but zero in heart-nature scores only 40 total — he does not reach the 80 passing line.</p><h2 id="ii-heart-nature-dimension-why-25-weight-is-heavier-than-it-looks" tabindex="-1">II. Heart-Nature Dimension: Why 25% Weight Is Heavier Than It Looks <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-heart-nature-dimension-why-25-weight-is-heavier-than-it-looks" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Heart-Nature Dimension: Why 25% Weight Is Heavier Than It Looks&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The heart-nature dimension&#39;s 25% weight looks not high, but it has a special property: <strong>one-vote veto.</strong> As long as the heart-nature dimension has &quot;predatory residue&quot; or &quot;anti-symbiotic stance,&quot; no matter how high the other three dimensions, recognition is denied — not points deducted, but direct veto.</p><p>The heart-nature dimension&#39;s assessment content includes:</p><ul><li><strong>Historical behavior review</strong>: all major behavior records throughout history are called up; any predatory behavior, any persecution record?</li><li><strong>Deep consciousness scan</strong>: under complete voluntariness, scan the cultivator&#39;s inner true thoughts, confirming his stance is not disguised.</li><li><strong>Situational stress test</strong>: set extreme moral dilemmas in a simulated environment, observing the cultivator&#39;s true choices under pressure.</li><li><strong>Long-term observation</strong>: for controversial candidates, conduct long-term observation over years to decades, confirming his heart-nature is stable.</li></ul><p>This assessment ensures: <strong>you cannot pass the heart-nature gate by &quot;pretending to be a good person.&quot;</strong> Stress tests and long-term observation will expose disguise — a person who under extreme dilemmas chooses predating to save himself, his &quot;symbiotic conviction&quot; is only a mask.</p><h2 id="iii-contribution-dimension-from-personal-cultivation-to-civilizational-level-contribution" tabindex="-1">III. Contribution Dimension: From &quot;Personal Cultivation&quot; to &quot;Civilizational-Level Contribution&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-contribution-dimension-from-personal-cultivation-to-civilizational-level-contribution" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Contribution Dimension: From &quot;Personal Cultivation&quot; to &quot;Civilizational-Level Contribution&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The contribution dimension&#39;s 20% weight assesses the cultivator&#39;s actual contribution to civilization. The key standard: <strong>contribution value reaches the civilization&#39;s top-20% level, with at least one civilization-level contribution record.</strong></p><p>Contribution types include:</p><ul><li>Cultivation contribution: new cultivation-manual creation, cultivation-theory innovation;</li><li>Knowledge contribution: enlightenment opening, education and training, academic research;</li><li>Technical contribution: law-engineering technology, Multiplication Fruit technology optimization;</li><li>Service contribution: anchor maintenance, civilizational governance, mentor guidance;</li><li>Ecological contribution: planetary ecological restoration, plane energy-cycle improvement;</li><li>Guardianship contribution: resisting external threats, disaster rescue.</li></ul><p>Six contribution types&#39; common trait: <strong>all are &quot;given out,&quot; not &quot;taken in.&quot;</strong> Your contribution to civilization is measured by what you did for Myriad Ranks, not by how strong you yourself are. A person who cultivates to the peak alone but never shares, never serves, his contribution value is zero — his power has not converted into civilizational increment.</p><h2 id="iv-responsibility-dimension-quantifying-the-strong-one-obligation-system" tabindex="-1">IV. Responsibility Dimension: Quantifying the Strong-One Obligation System <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-responsibility-dimension-quantifying-the-strong-one-obligation-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Responsibility Dimension: Quantifying the Strong-One Obligation System&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The responsibility dimension&#39;s 15% weight assesses the cultivator&#39;s willingness and ability to bear public responsibility. The core standard: <strong>at least 30% of time and effort annually invested in public responsibility.</strong></p><p>Concrete responsibility types include: anchor guardianship, civilizational advisory, mentor transmission, plane inspection, crisis response, law participation. The transcended one at the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm has stricter responsibility-dimension assessment — his public responsibility is not just 30%, but his post itself is public responsibility.</p><p>The responsibility dimension&#39;s only 15% weight is not because responsibility is unimportant, but because: <strong>the responsibility dimension is more &quot;bottom-line&quot; in nature.</strong> If you completely refuse to bear public responsibility, no matter how high the other three dimensions, recognition is denied — this is another one-vote-veto item. The 15% weight distinguishes &quot;basically qualified,&quot; but for &quot;complete responsibility-refusers&quot; it is zero tolerance.</p><h2 id="v-the-transcended-one-s-four-dimensional-assessment-stricter-than-the-origin-realm" tabindex="-1">V. The Transcended One&#39;s Four-Dimensional Assessment: Stricter Than the Origin Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-the-transcended-one-s-four-dimensional-assessment-stricter-than-the-origin-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. The Transcended One&#39;s Four-Dimensional Assessment: Stricter Than the Origin Realm&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one entering the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm already passed the four-dimensional assessment once at the Origin Realm. But after promotion to transcended one, the assessment standard upgrades:</p><ul><li><strong>Power dimension</strong>: no longer just &quot;reach Origin Realm,&quot; but requiring law-anchor capability at the hyper-multiverse scale;</li><li><strong>Heart-nature dimension</strong>: from &quot;firm anti-predation stance&quot; upgraded to &quot;withstanding power corrosion at the hyper-multiverse scale&quot; — the transcended one&#39;s law-anchor authority is too large; heart-nature testing is also greater;</li><li><strong>Contribution dimension</strong>: from &quot;civilization top-20%&quot; upgraded to &quot;have cross-plane-grade civilizational contribution records&quot;;</li><li><strong>Responsibility dimension</strong>: from &quot;30% time invested in public responsibility&quot; upgraded to &quot;post is public responsibility&quot; — the transcended one&#39;s whole existence is public service.</li></ul><p>The upgraded assessment essentially asks one question: <strong>when you hold hyper-multiverse-grade power, can you still keep the original heart of being a Myriad-Rank server?</strong> Keep it, you continue as transcended one; cannot keep it, authority downgrades, post hands over.</p><h2 id="vi-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">VI. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: four-dimensional assessment ensures those recognized as sovereign strong ones have their power steered to civilizational service, not idle or abused — eliminating great-talent-wasted</p></li><li><p><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the heart-nature dimension&#39;s one-vote veto seals predatory strong ones&#39; promotion channel at the admission stage</p></li><li><p><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo strong ones automatically become sovereign just by power size; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s plane-sovereign strong ones must meet all four dimensions; heart-nature substandard directly vetoed</p></li><li><p><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: four-dimensional assessment is open to all Myriad-Rank cultivators; each clan&#39;s cultivators meeting standards may be recognized, no racial threshold</p></li><li><p><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: four-dimensional assessment&#39;s weights, standards, procedures, and veto mechanisms are all publicly queryable; Myriad Ranks may supervise assessment fairness</p></li><li><p>Terminology alignment: the transcended one&#39;s civilizational weight dynamically adjusts with post performance; Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision monitors operation compliance throughout; the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle ensures energy and knowledge circulate perpetually among Myriad Ranks.</p></li><li><p><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</p></li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The plane-sovereign strong one&#39;s four-dimensional assessment is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s hardest institutional definition of &quot;strong.&quot; Power 40% is only the threshold; heart-nature 25% is the soul; contribution 20% is the value; responsibility 15% is the commitment. The four dimensions united are true &quot;sovereign.&quot; The old system looks only at power; Heng Yuan Zhou weights all four — this difference determines: the old system&#39;s sovereign strong ones are plane hegemons; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s sovereign strong ones are plane guardians. The transcended one transcends not because his power is largest, but because he is all-four-excellent — his power, heart-nature, contribution, and responsibility all point to the same direction: serving Myriad Ranks.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/17-位面至高强者标准.html">Entry 17 · Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standards</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/29-共生度评估体系.html">Entry 29 · Symbiosis-Degree Assessment System</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/23-20%激活战略规划.html">Entry 23 · 20% Activation Strategic Plan</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/816_模块4-超脱者与位面-总论.html">Entry 816 · Transcended Ones and Planes Overview</a></li></ul>',35)])])}const m=n(s,[["render",a]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
